<deviceset name="BME680" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:41385370/2" prefix="U" library_version="3">
<description>&lt;h3&gt;Bosch BME680 &amp;ndash; Combined Humidity and Pressure Sensor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The  BME680 is as combined digital humidity, pressure and temperature sensor based on proven sensing principles. The sensor module is housed in an extremely compact metal-lid LGA package  with a footprint of only 3.0×3.0mm with a height of 0.93mm. Its small dimensions and its low power consumption allow the implementation in battery driven devices such as handsets,  GPS modules or watches.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<gates>
